John,,Developer
,Bob,
Jane,J,Manager"#;

let result = replace_missing_entries(csv_data, "name", "nickname")
    .expect("Failed to process CSV");
println!("{}", result);
```

This will replace empty `name` entries with their corresponding `nickname` values.

