Notes:
- The parser runs on a lowercase copy of the input so keywords are matched case-insensitively; extraction uses the original string slices so the original casing is preserved in results.
- Add the pest and pest_derive dependencies to your Cargo.toml (shown below).
- The function returns a Vec<String> of matched expressions in the order they appear.

