/// Reorder elements of `lst0` to follow the ordering defined by `lst1`.
/// 
/// Elements in `lst0` that don't appear in `lst1` are appended at the end
/// in their original relative order.
/// 
/// # Arguments
/// * `lst0` - The list to reorder
