/// Renames row identifiers in a tabular data structure according to provided mappings.
/// 
/// # Arguments
/// * `df0` - A HashMap where keys are row identifiers and values are row data (as HashMaps)
/// * `dict0` - A HashMap containing the mapping from old row identifiers to new ones
/// 
