/// Retrieves the indices of the N elements with the highest `var0` values from `lst0`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `lst0` - A slice of structs containing `var0` values (must implement `Ord` for comparison)
/// * `n` - The number of top elements to retrieve
///
/// # Returns
