- Orientation::Columns — treat the first row as column headers; produce a map keyed by those headers with each value being the column's entries (all rows after the header).
- Orientation::Rows — treat the first cell of each row as the row key; produce a map keyed by those first-cell values with each value being the remaining cells in that row.

